/***************************************************************
 Project name                  : ADR SoC
 File Name                     : verilator.vlt
 Module/class Name             : Verilator configuration
 Author                        : Vijay Bogati
 Description                   : Verilator lint waivers for the third-party folders
***************************************************************/

// Lint waivers for Verilator. Upstream's own rules match its original folders, so the blocks that
// moved out of them need these to keep the same treatment.

`verilator_config

lint_off -file "*/third_party_ip/common/*"
lint_off -file "*/third_party_ip/plic/*"
lint_off -file "*/third_party_ip/clint/*"
lint_off -file "*/third_party_ip/debug/*"
